[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Out of the Darkness]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:10.68]Why was the girl in hospital? | 那个女孩为什么住院？
[00:14.62]Nearly a week passed before | 几乎过了一个星期，
[00:16.96]the girl was able to explain | 那女孩才能讲述
[00:19.54]what had happened to her. | 自己的遭遇。
[00:23.15]One afternoon she set out | 一天下午，她乘小船
[00:25.70]from the coast in a small boat | 从海岸出发，
[00:28.22]and was caught in a storm. | 遇到了风暴。
[00:31.49]Towards evening, | 天将黑时，
[00:33.09]the boat struck a rock and | 小船撞在了一块礁石上，
[00:35.13]the girl jumped into the sea. | 女孩跳进了海里。
[00:38.30]Then she swam to the shore | 她在海里游了整整一夜，
[00:40.63]after spending the whole night in the water. | 然后才游到岸边。
[00:44.71]During that time she covered | 在那段时间里，她游了
[00:47.50]a distance of eight miles. | 8英里的距离。
[00:50.81]Early next morning, | 第二天清晨，
[00:52.90]she saw a light ahead. | 她看到前方有灯光，
[00:55.80]She knew she was near the shore | 知道自己已经接近岸边了，
[00:58.90]because the light was high up on the cliffs. | 因为那灯光是在高高的峭壁上。
[01:03.51]On arriving at the shore, | 到达岸边后，
[01:06.16]the girl struggled up the cliff towards | 女孩朝着她看到的灯光
[01:09.56]the light she had seen. | 挣扎着往峭壁上爬去。
[01:12.09]That was all she remembered. | 她所记得的就是这些。
[01:15.17]When she woke up a day later, | 第二天她醒来时，
[01:17.97]she found herself in hospital. | 发现自己躺在医院里。
